+# Fresh W-FULL preparation at the repaired runtime
+
+This is the existing successful Windows preparation path from commit `095ed1623d5fa22ac6f2e306702142d071135db6`, rebound to the independently received corrected runtime. It creates one new actual subject and stops at a new exact operation record. It contains no protected `execute` command or continuation job.
+
+| Binding | Exact value |
+|---|---|
+| Qualified runtime | `6b353b48b2fc8a6de0c6223f48d341c484c98191` |
+| Runtime tree | `92da6bf5f9d2d8d7ea723b56f2e99c838a9d984b` |
+| Fresh preparation branch | `engineering/pro-dg18-w-full-repaired-prepare-20261116` |
+| Required sole parent of the preparation commit | `6b353b48b2fc8a6de0c6223f48d341c484c98191` |
+| Original future measurement limits | 60,000 ms; 201,326,592 bytes peak aggregate Job committed memory; zero baseline subtraction |
+
+## Ordinary launch
+
+After distinct source review, Root creates the fresh branch at the exact runtime commit, then performs one guarded non-forced update to the reviewed preparation commit with that sole parent. Creating a branch alone is not the launch. The workflow accepts only the first attempt of that real continuation push, with exact event predecessor, branch and sole parent; a later linear push cannot re-arm it. Root retains the actual resource/noninterference check and publication.
+
+The workflow selects the existing `windows-2022` runner, pinned Python3.12.10 and a fixed physical direct Git image. It checks out the packet separately from the clean qualified runtime and executes:
+
+```powershell
+& $physicalPython -I -X utf8 -B $packetPrepare `
+  --source $qualifiedSource --python $physicalPython `
+  --bash 'C:\Program Files\Git\usr\bin\bash.exe' --git $directGit `
+  --out $newOutput --controller $actualController `
+  --preparation-authorization-reference $actualPreparationInstruction
+```
+
+The exact workflow fills those arguments. Output and controller are newly named `dg18-w-full-<actual-run-id>-1`; the owner creates fresh claim/run identities and the output directory refuses reuse. The existing real initialization, separate document reads, first resume/currentness, first canonical rotation and explicit manual invalidation are retained unchanged. This boundary is not a host-compaction occurrence. The existing driver then runs `prepare` with the runtime commit/tree above and retains the new `operation/OPERATION.json`, its digest, preflight/raw command outputs, `PREPARATION.json` and complete `SUBJECT.tar`, including the subject's real Git refs and objects.
+
+Only the selected source commit/tree in `prepare.py`, the source commit in `task_bodies.py`, and the workflow's source/branch/guard/preparation-reference bindings change from the successful preparation. The helpers' executable behavior is otherwise unchanged. The three maintained Windows driver/checker/Job-accounting files are unchanged; this preparation does not measure or claim the future protected result. It does not repeat accepted suites or rebuild packages.
+
+## Separate protected decision
+
+The actual new operation and its bytes must first be independently received. A fresh owner grant must name that exact operation before the maintained restore/execute continuation can be rebound and used. No old operation identity, grant, subject, receipt or accepting result is reused. Original operation `e0ac5d2992e44b45e838802c571fa84e27542aa72afab6ebb05c015e3207ec23` remains consumed with its successful G0003 transition and failed192-MiB qualification.
+
+The prior owner's retirement of two concurrent DG16/DG17 owner originals explicitly applied to “this W-FULL operation” e0ac. This preparation neither revives that retired condition for e0ac nor silently extends the exception to the future record. Root must resolve the new grant's exact applicable scope while preserving genuine current noninterference; no substitute owner records or availability watches are created here. Preparation itself is authorized by the owner's current continuation direction and does not spend a protected grant.
+
+N1 remains LOST/UNKNOWN and unconsumed, with no criterion-5 exception. This fresh subject does not replace its originals or complete amended cold receiving. No OR producer/issuer grant, C02 decision/erroneous-event census, authentic prior/retry occurrence, model turn or whole-R0039 acceptance is supplied by this packet.
